  "review_notes": [
    "The two articles before νοσσιάν and πτέρυγας are decided differently: ἑαυτῆς displaces the first, while nothing competes for the supplied *her* of the second (rules 20, 76).",
    "ὃν τρόπον → *even as* is one noncompositional unit; splitting *even* onto ὅν and *as* onto τρόπον would assign words neither token separately licenses."
